    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55155" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκην-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take up one's quarters, encamp</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.5.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hell.Oxy.</u>
				16.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ch.</u>
				23.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθα κατεσκηνώκατε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.2.2
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>rest</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἐλπίδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					15(16).9
				</span></i>
			; <i>settle</i>, of birds, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν κλάδοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					13.32
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ ψυχὴ ἐν μόνῳ ἀνθρώπῳ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
